  "title": "Guitar Intermediate (16+)",
  "summary": "Guitar Intermediate (16+)",
  "description": "Register Here Starting December 8! Registration for all Aurora Cultural Centre programs is on the Town of Aurora’s e-PLAY website. All programs continue to be part of the Aurora Cultural Centre. January 14 – March 4, 2026 Wednesdays | 7:30 – 8:45 pm | Ages 16+ Aurora Town Square – Shining Hill Visual Arts Studio A 50 Victoria Street, Aurora Take your guitar skills to the next level in this 8-week adult intermediate program! Building on your knowledge of chords and strumming, you’ll explore more complex techniques such as fingerpicking, barre chords, and soloing. Learn to play more challenging songs, improve your rhythm, and develop a deeper understanding of music theory. This program is perfect for those who are ready to expand their playing and gain more confidence in their musical abilities. Participants are to provide their own instrument.",
